width:600px;height:600px" class="container-nMN7P5 video-QVQ58Y"><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load poster-PTtNqM" style="width:600px;height:600px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide" style="height:600px;width:1058.8235294117646px"><div style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px" class="container-nMN7P5 video-QVQ58Y"><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load poster-PTtNqM" style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide" style="height:600px;width:1058.8235294117646px"><div style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px" class="container-nMN7P5 video-QVQ58Y"><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load poster-PTtNqM" style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide" style="height:600px;width:1058.8235294117646px"><div style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px" class="container-nMN7P5 video-QVQ58Y"><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load poster-PTtNqM" style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide" style="height:600px;width:1058.8235294117646px"><div style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px" class="container-nMN7P5 video-QVQ58Y"><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load poster-PTtNqM" style="width:1058.8235294117646px;height:600px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gallery-R9gleh"></div></div></div><div class="container-QWOTsk"><header class="header-X3degc"><div><h1 class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy title-snzzKZ" style="color:#212121;margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Model Performance</h1><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy description-kijszn" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Below are the results of Seedance 1.0 in internal benchmarks using SeedVideoBench-1.0 and on the third-party platform Artificial Analysis.</div></div></header><div class="charts-OjqJj0"><div class="content-title-SJUNph"><h1 class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy main-title-KinscW" style="color:#212121;margin:0;word-break:keep-all">SeedVideoBench-1.0: Multi-Dimensional Evaluation</h1><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy subtitle-nTlpu_" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">In comparison with other industry models, Seedance 1.0 performed well across core dimensions including prompt adherence, motion quality, and aesthetics.</div></div><div class="hide-scrollbar charts-imgs-eikMvJ"><div class="img-container-zFOTVF"><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil title-b0Huyi" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">T2V Radar Chart</div><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load img-iqWrFT" style="width:-56px;height:300px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil image-description-VQtv2Z" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Achieved high scores in T2V tasks for prompt adherence, motion quality, and aesthetics. Due to unavailable public data, the Elo score for Kling 2.1 is taken from Kling 2.0.</div></div><div class="img-container-zFOTVF"><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil title-b0Huyi" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">I2V Radar Chart</div><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load img-iqWrFT" style="width:-56px;height:300px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil image-description-VQtv2Z" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Also achieved high scores in I2V tasks, while effectively maintaining consistency with the source image. Due to unavailable public data, the Elo score for Kling 2.1 is taken from Kling 2.0.</div></div></div></div><div class="table-EZkqnO"><div class="content-title-SJUNph"><h1 class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy main-title-KinscW" style="color:#212121;margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Artificial Analysis Video Arena</h1><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy subtitle-nTlpu_" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all"></div></div><div class="hide-scrollbar charts-imgs-eikMvJ"><div class="img-container-zFOTVF"><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil title-b0Huyi" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">T2V Leaderboard</div><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load img-iqWrFT" style="width:-56px;height:300px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil image-description-VQtv2Z" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Source: Artificial Analysis official website. As of 2025-06-09 11:00 (GMT+8).</div></div><div class="img-container-zFOTVF"><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil title-b0Huyi" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">I2V Leaderboard</div><div class="arco-image arco-image-before-load img-iqWrFT" style="width:-56px;height:300px"><img class="arco-image-img" tabindex="0"/><div class="arco-image-overlay"></div></div><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil image-description-VQtv2Z" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Source: Artificial Analysis official website. As of 2025-06-09 11:00 (GMT+8).</div></div></div></div></div><div class="container-mOXhe5"><header class="header-JPsy9C"><h1 class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy title-HVSBgr" style="color:#212121;margin:0;word-break:keep-all">Creativity Unleashed, Explore the Possibilities</h1><div class="arco-typography text-qXYiil text-animation-mOzIGy description-mBRZds description-en-vCD1xP" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all">From surreal fantasy and daily life documentaries t