,"try_it_now":"https:\u002F\u002Fjimeng.jianying.com\u002Fai-tool\u002Fgenerate\u002F?type=video","try_it_now_en":"https:\u002F\u002Fdreamina.capcut.com\u002Fai-tool\u002Fhome\u002F?type=video","get_api":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.volcengine.com\u002Fdocs\u002F82379\u002F1520757","get_api_en":"https:\u002F\u002Fconsole.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ark+ap-southeast-1\u002Fmodel\u002Fdetail?Id=seedance-1-0-pro"},"seedanceHighlights":{"title":"关键亮点","description":"Seedream 3.0 在文本到图像生成方面取得了突破性进展，在人类偏好评估和自动基准测试等关键指标上均显著超越现有模型。","data":[{"title":"流畅稳定的运动表现","description":"Seedance 1.0 具备良好的动态范围，能够流畅地生成大幅度的运动。从细微的表情到动态场景，均能保持高水平的稳定性与物理真实感。","data":[{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fbd1ab9892659795f9708289bf3ad62cd\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FokAhAowBq7sE7fF96PIAFPSCQFgfEhzOACRIkD\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=7925&bt=7925&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=Mzo0bnM5cjtqNDczNGllM0BpMzo0bnM5cjtqNDczNGllM0BlbzJuMmRjajBhLS1kXy9zYSNlbzJuMmRjajBhLS1kXy9zcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","description":"清晨，一位少年骑着自行⻋穿过欧洲老城区。镜头从石板 路上的⻋轮切入，切换为街边行人的仰视视⻆，再是他穿梭巷道的 第三人称航拍视⻆，最后以他驶入阳光洒满的广场作为结束画面。","description_en":"In the morning, a teenager cycles through an old European city district. The shot cuts from the bicycle wheels on cobblestone streets to a front-facing perspective of him riding, and finally ends with him pedaling into a sunlit square.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoUQHsohqEG2wSFSh7CCIZgACLheRBEDz7Qyf9P~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F&x-expires=2064908599&x-signature=3ygxRleo9tZr3%2FLeZz4wCIvgFzM%3D","compress_src":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F45a13258009aeafe32f3c39412331a8e\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FokwQDffV7E8DEBXNzAogFBCCEb9lSAbCBAWA3i\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=3112&bt=3112&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2d3ank5cjg4NDczNGllM0BpM2d3ank5cjg4NDczNGllM0AuamptMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzYSMuamptMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"赛车在金字塔前的赛道上呼啸而过，黄沙在轮胎下扬起。镜头贴地，赛车飞驰过弯，沙尘飘散。多个赛车在蜿蜒赛道上交错超车，构图呈现金字塔剪影与疾速并存的张力。【高空无人机镜头】俯瞰整条沙漠赛道，展示车流轨迹与落日余晖交织的动态美感。","description_en":"Race cars roar past on a track in front of the pyramids, kicking up yellow sand under their tires. The camera stays close to the ground as the cars speed through curves, sending dust flying. Multiple racers weave and overtake each other on the winding track, with the composition highlighting the tension between the pyramids' silhouettes and the breakneck speed. [Aerial drone shot] Overlooking the entire desert track, it showcases the dynamic beauty of racing lines interwoven with the glow of the setting sun.","width":"1248","height":"1664","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoAlzDFD897AVuIEVXCEECwBSXBbgBfL3QofCNx~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=fCK1StyOpkjQ0MF%2FtG%2BoC%2BdyPRc%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fc9f5ca6e40fb231a41d08b04e4ab0b37\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoACCgQDQFEoBFVbw2DfB9zVSCfNHXl73SEACMI\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1103&bt=1103&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=ZDs8MzZoOjdnNWVpZjU3aEBpM2d3ank5cjg4NDczNGllM0AwYjM2NF8uXzQxL2E2NmFhYSMuamptMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F7242d6c9ac0bd92b6a95e6dfedebdeca\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoktF77BTEU9DBCA7kf2iGEvIoLA8fDtDRAEgSA\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=7537&bt=7537&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=amc0cXU5cmhpNDczNGllM0Bpamc0cXU5cmhpNDczNGllM0BxNG01MmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzYSNxNG01MmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","description":"「I2V」在街上，镜头跟随拍摄了一群人骑着马向前行走。","description_en":"[I2V] On the street, the camera follows a group of people riding horses as they walk forward.","width":"1664","height":"1248","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoooLDSGi7BtEvSF92ATIfLyB4R7IgKfF2C8DE7~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F&x-expires=2064908599&x-signature=ahOeoZBJiPP3aA9COGeHQFMhKO8%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fe91ec1cd3306548d2f645fc26885191b\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fokf7RtMpvof3IgEb8ITFi7cDBlB7RE9GC2DSQA\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2073&bt=2073&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=NGlpNzhmOWU4aDZoZDZpZUBpamc0cXU5cmhpNDczNGllM0AvNGMzXy00NWAxMGAtNV8vYSNxNG01MmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F462bc6f506a066c0ff9a472267078120\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FooL7Wf3G7gteBaAEA44iSdBD8AIiEdBK0HhEAB\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=5638&bt=5638&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=Mzo2NXI5cmhpNDczNGllM0BpMzo2NXI5cmhpNDczNGllM0BfamsvMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzYSNfamsvMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","description":"滑雪者在滑雪，他转弯时扬起大片雪雾，沿着山坡逐渐加速，镜头平稳地移动着。","description_en":"A skier glides over fresh snow, kicking up large clouds of snow as he turns. Accelerating gradually down the slope, the camera moves smoothly alongside.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FowvIDFDN97AwZQe70GEIVCBS8C2gLwlxRofsOp~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F&x-expires=2064908599&x-signature=jyA2kU3RZyzH50M%2FlZxKsB9%2FCEA%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fa40c3dc1c2351c4597bc345a02b2eb8d\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoEK8MQBW0lAEGH4GB4iighBd7ISeIXhEIEf7D3\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2476&bt=2476&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=OTdoMzs8ZDY1PDg6OmZoO0BpMzo2NXI5cmhpNDczNGllM0BhYjRjNmFjNl4xNGE1YC9hYSNfamsvMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Ff4966fb61c8f71139a48c1912554b4dd\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo0I9wDoSlG5IePKEDAIXdQFChAABYgfwEu7AVB\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=4071&bt=4071&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=amhqNXI5cjY4NDczNGllM0BpamhqNXI5cjY4NDczNGllM0Bma2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNma2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"场景设定：一个广阔的科幻机库或对接舱，向外望去是未来主义的天际线 —— 高耸入云的尖塔沐浴在冷冽的日光中。地面是抛光金属材质，映出细微的建筑细节。  镜头从阴影笼罩的机库内部深处开始，低位居中，向外凝视。镜头缓慢前推，逐渐展现更多由敞开的舱口框住的明亮天际线。 推进时，地面上柔和的蓝色反光闪烁延伸。远处的高耸城市景观愈发清晰 —— 抽象、高得不可思议的庞大建筑群。 天际线上的光线微妙变化，暗示某种运动的开始 —— 或许有什么正在抵达，或即将启程。 最后几秒在机库地面边缘与外部平台相接时结束 —— 城市仍遥不可及，却似乎蕴藏着潜在的能量。","description_en":"Setting: A vast sci-fi hangar or docking bay, looking out onto a futuristic skyline of towering spires bathed in cold daylight. The floor is polished metal, reflecting subtle architectural detail. The camera begins deep inside the shadowed hangar interior, centered low to the ground, looking out. It slowly tracks forward, revealing more of the illuminated skyline framed by the open bay. As it advances, soft blue reflections on the floor shimmer and stretch. The towering cityscape in the distance becomes clearer—abstract, impossibly tall, monolithic. A subtle shift in light across the skyline suggests the start of movement—perhaps something is arriving, or about to depart.The final seconds end just as the edge of the hangar floor meets the outer platform—the city still distant, unreachable, yet pulsing with latent energy.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoI7sDHEgD2SiliSX99eu4IfKH4BxABTILBA0EC~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=YnjlB44evjB0oK7hggVIrmEhgCc%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F8c9f80ce74fedaa50412dfa45e0fd980\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoUQSKBElDKDD9TgdwIFXFeEAfwDgioI7uYQPVx\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1572&bt=1572&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=OjM8NWg5PDlkOjY8OGZoM0BpamhqNXI5cjY4NDczNGllM0BgXi9iMzRhXzAxNF42NDBjYSNma2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fc39470a1ef2e4b0456c47bf43f9e8709\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo0wCeSvN0EDA7AA4XBIiyB4iEsBAEWSLKgfQBK\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2246&bt=2246&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=ampqNXI5cjg4NDczNGllM0BpampqNXI5cjg4NDczNGllM0Bra2kvMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNra2kvMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"一位身着黑色露背礼服的模特优雅地走在鲜艳的红色 T 台上。光线展现出面料的流动感。观众席间的目光追随模特，最后灯光渐暗。","description_en":"A model in a black backless gown walks gracefully on a vibrant red runway. Light showcases the fluidity of the fabric. Sight of the audience follows the model, and finally, the lights dim.","width":"1664","height":"1248","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoUE0Wy4sFS94BercgEivIXDBKfKwLBSiA7BNCI~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908254&x-signature=94awt6B5gc%2Bl%2B5aoh61YEEefI8k%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F7b9a2cd24c80229ae5e89b0d5c5e266f\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FocwJrCAhelglegUCiG7QqJC8cIBGL3ovQLWQfg\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=872&bt=872&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=N2llZ2Q3Nzw2ZzQ7ZzVkaUBpampqNXI5cjg4NDczNGllM0AyYy8wMjA2NTExYjBfLzYwYSNra2kvMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"}],"title_en":"Smooth & Stable Motion","description_en":"Seedance 1.0 features a wide dynamic range, enabling smooth generation of large-scale movements. From subtle expressions to active scenes, it maintains a high level of stability and physical realism. ","compress_src":""},{"title":"原生多镜头叙事能力","description":"原生支持生成包含多个连贯镜头的叙事性视频。在镜头切换与时空变换中，能确保核心主体、视觉风格与整体氛围的高度一致。","data":[{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fd17d4247bfec7c2a0554ba4b41b5a90b\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo4BA4AB8iAuHIXCKAeqrSBL7E4sEEDAfg0SKUi\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=10023&bt=10023&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=amhqNXI5cjY4NDczNGllM0BpamhqNXI5cjY4NDczNGllM0Bpa2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNpa2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"【低角度追踪镜头】一只小狐狸在林间轻快地奔跑。 阳光透过树叶的缝隙洒下。 小狐狸停下，警惕地竖起耳朵。 【切换镜头】它发现了危险，迅速转身逃跑，镜头跟随小狐狸在复杂的林地中躲避追捕。","description_en":"[Low-angle tracking shot] A small fox trots nimbly through the forest. Sunlight filters down through gaps in the leaves. The fox stops, alertly perking up its ears. [Cut to]Spotting danger, it quickly turns and flees, with the camera chasing after the fox as it dodges through the dense woods.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoQPfEIPQgww9SIYCo8Q6VBF57XAEDlfuBdEWDx~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=xU9uNHpGDU%2BL2DRO0a2ebmv0gy4%3D","compress_src":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F635ec561caa70f097cf2320b83fa5aaa\u002F7b13ffe3\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FokBIDEHEB3u4SBXMgifAS9AA5inlA0A7Q5Ze2C\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1114&bt=1114&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=amZ5c3M5cjY4NDczNGllM0BpamZ5c3M5cjY4NDczNGllM0BgZmJnMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNgZmJnMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"多个镜头。一名侦探进入一间光线昏暗的房间。他检查桌上的线索，手里拿起桌上的某个物品，镜头转向他，若有所思的样子。","description_en":"Multiple shots. A detective enters a dimly lit room. He examines the clues on the table, picks up an object from the surface, and the camera turns to him, capturing a thoughtful expression.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FosYEPPwEuL9vCQeIlBFoSuCDgyDkIA4BflQ7yz~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908259&x-signature=a06XV%2BR%2Fw6QUl0Py%2BmVesFUrhto%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Ff4c84e268a817bb38d7f33a34a384695\u002F7b13ffe3\u002Fvi