HfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2hqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0BpM2hqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0Bza2kvMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzYSNza2kvMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"一位欧洲新娘在婚礼前几分钟独自站在化妆镜前。镜头从镜中她微笑整理发饰的特写切入，转到桌上散落的化妆品、香水瓶，新郎打开门，新郎的身影从模糊逐渐清晰。","description_en":"A European bride stands alone in front of a vanity mirror minutes before her wedding. The shot begins with a close-up of her smiling reflection in the mirror as she adjusts her hairpiece, then pans to a table scattered with cosmetics and perfume bottles. As the groom opens the door, his figure gradually comes into focus from a blur.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FokfQwdBtloVlEgEFXYXFI7NDB4UeQI9CwwDSBA~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=PXlzoa6i%2Bnmsq8MbEUOcdQAweOw%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fcbd9949246fa36efc1b1e856f7003b6a\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FosdIMDwQ8CFlAeQf7gwEVDoDuK9XQSy0EIYBgl\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1115&bt=1115&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=PGU5PDk3PDhlOzs2NzU2ZUBpM2hqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0BfY2NeX18xXmIxNC8uYTAvYSNza2kvMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F4a3c0a63072125567af592df370e2e73\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoQ3CEMQEPJEDLcBQABfalBAtXighidA5nJAE85\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2368&bt=2368&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=amZ5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0BpamZ5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0BqZmJnMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzYSNqZmJnMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"镜头从废墟中前行机器人脚步切入，切至头部 光学镜头扫描特写，再转为它视⻆中的城市轮廓扫描 图像，最终定格在墙上涂鸦‘HUMANITY?’。","description_en":"A robot moves through ruins. The shot cuts to a close-up of its optical scanning lens on the head, then shifts to a scanned image of the city's outline from its perspective. Graffiti on the wall reads \"HUMANITY?\".","width":"1088","height":"1920","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FocfAcigFBlEP15EnBar1JthChhEdIq53BJXMiQ~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908254&x-signature=30IE77aQH%2BooPiMm%2BGRQETYUr14%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F1b3e93494dfcbb6d70d8f183a14b5fac\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoY7vpQQgDlSFaEluyf9ZzQfL5wDyAB5IyVCoPE\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1112&bt=1112&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=Z2c6ZzY5M2g5ZGZoaDg6ZkBpamZ5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0AuYTQuX19hNTIxYWIzXzEtYSNqZmJnMmQ0bC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"}],"title_en":"Native Multi-Shot Storytelling","description_en":"Natively supports the generation of narrative videos with multiple cohesive shots. It maintains consistency in the main subject, visual style, and atmosphere across shot transitions and temporal-spatial shifts.","compress_src":""},{"title":"多样的风格化表达","description":"无论是写实摄影、赛博朋克，还是手绘插画、毛毡特效，Seedance 1.0 都能准确响应多样的风格指令，以支持各类创意需求。","data":[{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Ffc4544655aabea527da10cf799daa40b\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoICI7AfqEFSIdRAgI9FDD7x2vO4ACwoNuAVfBX\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=3599&bt=3599&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=ajo2NXI5cmhpNDczNGllM0Bpajo2NXI5cmhpNDczNGllM0BeamsvMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzYSNeamsvMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","description":"一位探险家航行在低多边形风格的海洋上，水面泛起多面体的波浪，头顶掠过多边形的飞鸟。镜头围绕小船进行旋转，阳光以锐利的角度折射开来。画面虽简约却生动鲜明。","description_en":"Low-polygon style, an adventurer sails on an ocean where the water shimmers with polyhedral waves, and polygonal birds sweep across the sky. The camera rotates around the small boat as sunlight refracts at sharp angles. The scene is vivid and striking.","width":"1088","height":"1920","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoQVXNS2YvDCgxEQoCRFfABgfO4GKCqII9TDw77~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F&x-expires=2064908599&x-signature=wXAqYpnj20xRQwrSGddznJl2ssA%3D","compress_src":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv11-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F58e35ba5de0f61c7639f1d5f4d2d90a7\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FosJEhiBRfdgYzEAFyCiEKcAJXALQB4AsEav3wB\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2805&bt=2805&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=ampqNXI5cjg4NDczNGllM0BpampqNXI5cjg4NDczNGllM0Bva2kvMmRrbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNva2kvMmRrbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"一幅充满活力的插画，描绘了一只蓝色金刚鹦鹉，位于构图中央。使用大胆、欢快且清晰的色彩。用充满活力、色彩丰富的背景围绕金刚鹦鹉，背景中融入艺术图形元素和有机形状。确保整幅作品的视觉和谐。风格鲜明，富有表现力，并富有创意和艺术感。","description_en":"A vibrant illustration depicts a blue macaw at the center of the composition. It uses bold, cheerful, and clear colors. Surround the macaw with a lively and colorful background that incorporates artistic graphic elements and organic shapes. Ensure the visual harmony of the entire work. The style is distinct, expressive, and full of creativity and artistry.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoYAwIDuIWDSCuVxe1lFwA9oDC7XghB9QQYfMEE~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=tL9aL4LDA8sr0B7zTkZwOZFjAjY%3D","compress_src":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fe74f1d4afad4142b83e4010a98159e2a\u002F7b1433e8\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoANix7BxETeDBuAUYf4ECEWt0yA1KBkqIAigSA\u002F?a=611830\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026er=0\\u0026lr=default\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=1839\\u0026bt=1839\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoY-Iv-_vjVQWw\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=amdxNXI5cmRnNDczNGllM0BpamdxNXI5cmRnNDczNGllM0BsL2kvMmRjYi5hLS1kXzBzYSNsL2kvMmRjYi5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=c0000e00008000\\u0026dy_q=1749561568\\u0026l=2025061021192882AF9DF2998D9CE6E58C","description":"霓虹色调，融合复古印刷美学与街头风格。一只穿着连帽衫、戴着墨镜的酷蛙随着节拍缓缓点头。它身后，霓虹粉色背景微微脉动。","description_en":"Neon palette, mix of retro print aesthetic and streetwear flair. A chill frog in a hoodie and sunglasses nods slowly in rhythm. Behind him, the neon pink background pulses slightly in sync. ","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FogkBiBtEW74hNRuCEBTyifxUD1IP0ISKrAxegG~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749211638&l=20250606200716228AFAECAD3AE896127A&x-expires=2064571646&x-signature=70O%2FO4ePdlzgoyioBb8UBwSYBXg%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F7c499f7720bf43252bc68602aa5a3799\u002F7b1433e8\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoMVIDIUEBtGuWB1NgifzSFN3xiEK10A7Y4xehC\u002F?a=611830\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026er=0\\u0026lr=default\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=881\\u0026bt=881\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoY-Iv-_vjVQWw\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=0\\u0026rc=ZzQ7OTRpOGZlNDY2ZDY5aUBpamdxNXI5cmRnNDczNGllM0BjMjFgLTUwNTMxLS4tMDNeYSNsL2kvMmRjYi5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=c0000e00008000\\u0026dy_q=1749561568\\u0026feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299\\u0026l=2025061021192882AF9DF2998D9CE6E58C"},{"sr