rembles slightly.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FokiAd40IClNBGB3XgJDBSfiyi7SeRBI5MV5nzE~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908255&x-signature=4gIhOjrNFIWWr0H72ttEbbfRVvI%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Fd06b90eba6dcce2a90ed81105ee250ef\u002F7b13ffdf\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoApvul4PDIiDqEzwSyFgDh9TaBfwoCAQEegL7Q\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1796&bt=1796&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=aDo4NmZkZjY3NzplNjo3OkBpamd5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0A2MWMvXmBjNTExMmJeMV4uYSNeZmJnMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837"},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F8303dbd7c713df1dbc38c91e1eac6246\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo0oADBCzTBMElSF9fAbECBNAAQ73gLfBBwXDEy\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=794&bt=794&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2Z3ank5cjc4NDczNGllM0BpM2Z3ank5cjc4NDczNGllM0BtamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNtamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"「I2V」镜头缓慢旋转，袖子微微飘动","description_en":"[I2V] The camera rotates slowly as sleeves flutter gently.","width":"1440","height":"1440","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FocSZm1fv2AYLJMe4eohGW7YhHDQvgCPXEBeB4C~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908254&x-signature=Cn0gTWrvybAl2Fxje3JFkBO4Wxc%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Ffdc33e66da64b311863acfa5e3425bed\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FocX7DEyDgMlB3wbFfVo9ADSfIzCCBQEBlTspuD\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=363&bt=363&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=aDhnZjs0NzkzM2RoNDQ0M0BpM2Z3ank5cjc4NDczNGllM0BgXzFfMS01Xy4xMGEzNGItYSNtamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","useInMobile":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F8e14461a17ac2ef5d47032f8406ecdfc\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoEAuuX7mGICBsEfAL2LAMe2fXEejhACIITBFvC\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=10028&bt=10028&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2V3ank5cjY4NDczNGllM0BpM2V3ank5cjY4NDczNGllM0BvamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNvamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"场景设定：水下峡谷中，缕缕阳光穿透水面。一头鲸鱼在珊瑚峭壁间轻柔游弋。镜头以俯拍水面波动的阳光开场，缓慢下摇，从阴影中浮现鲸鱼庞大的身躯。当它完全游入视野时，镜头缓缓后拉，展现环境的浩瀚尺度。最后一秒，鲸鱼微微转身。","description_en":"In an underwater canyon, streaks of sunlight pierce the water's surface. A whale glides gently between coral cliffs. The shot begins with an overhead view of rippling sunlight on the water, then slowly tilts downward to reveal the whale's massive form emerging from the shadows. As it fully swims into view, the camera pulls back gradually to showcase the vast scale of the environment. In the final second, the whale turns slightly.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002Fo0zoDVw33SEfB9tzgEF2QXDDPfCLbBlEA7BhCI~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908257&x-signature=FAoOh3BFRFe04zAVvJ2BiiDhpn0%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F815643e4fd700c013caa6c02114deb1b\u002F7b13ffe1\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FokDvseXE2Be2GRFIgufILfEMuCCLQA9FhXAma6\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=2760&bt=2760&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=NWY8OTc6ZTo7M2doODM7O0BpM2V3ank5cjY4NDczNGllM0A0MC8xNTYxNV8xLzRgMi8vYSNvamptMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","useInMobile":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F25d18c7d0260855a5f89cf8cafecf8b8\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo0A3AovBQaCE7xF9M9EAasSDf8gfw78GABRELD\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=3443&bt=3443&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M3d3OXg5cmhpNDczNGllM0BpM3d3OXg5cmhpNDczNGllM0BsaXMxMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzYSNsaXMxMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","description":"在一片静谧的雪景中，一只红色的纸鹤于风中轻盈飘荡，姿态优雅地振翅翻飞。镜头追随着它掠过湖面，湖面上倒映着山峦与苍白的太阳。","description_en":"In a still, snowy landscape, a red paper crane floats in the wind, fluttering gracefully. The camera follows it across a lake, reflecting mountains and a pale sun.","width":"1088","height":"1920","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoQFCLOHoRSbaA97BE83vN98BDwGfIlfj7QwgED~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548594&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F&x-expires=2064908599&x-signature=AxY%2F%2FyfbVldTqkR5w%2FMJ%2BfGfhNg%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F2e502ee295a7159b28b115ac54d84be2\u002F7b140137\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fog1GMQ3IGeAFeE87BIeMLXbE1LhvehCvc4g2wG\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1418&bt=1418&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8ZmoE558-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=OzM4Mzo1ZGc6aDk5ZDRnNkBpM3d3OXg5cmhpNDczNGllM0A2YWA2L2MuXzAxXmAyYTBiYSNsaXMxMmRzLjBhLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548594&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017431429D3DBBD793C36B1B91F","useInMobile":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F68518114676f2e0fc58a0340d5365e98\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FosiG3Ae7EASfBEBCA0Aglyn5DBi4MXIBSavIw5\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=5406&bt=5406&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2Z5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0BpM2Z5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0BtZmJnMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzYSNtZmJnMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"蓝青色调，全景拍摄一位年轻的白人男子在户外滑板公园内玩滑板。他留着黑色短发，身着白色T恤、黑色长裤和黑白相间的运动鞋。他双臂张开，低着头，身体倾斜，正在用滑板的边缘做滑铲动作。周围的滑板台上有凹槽和陡坡，背景中有树木和一些人。天空湛蓝，飘着几朵云。在滑板公园里，镜头跟随拍摄一个男人站在滑板上，他向画面右侧滑去，随后他跳起旋转身体，双脚踩在滑板上，在空中旋转了两圈后落在地上继续向前滑行。","description_en":"Blue-toned scene, panoramic shot of a young white man skateboarding in an outdoor skatepark. He has short black hair, wearing a white T-shirt, black pants, and black-and-white sneakers. With arms outstretched, head lowered, and body tilted, he performs a slide action using the edge of his skateboard. The surrounding skate platforms feature grooves and steep slopes, with trees and people in the background. The sky is a clear blue with a few clouds. In the skatepark, the camera follows the man as he stands on his skateboard and glides to the right of the frame. He then jumps, twists his body, keeps both feet on the skateboard, spins twice in the air, lands, and continues to slide forward.","width":"1088","height":"1920","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp3-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FocIEQCAu9uvQSPDoPF6NfZuLkwz7REvgDylCBe~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908254&x-signature=IVj%2BvmOSFp0ry3gQNapmYl%2Fw3IU%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv26-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002Feee323e89257afe8bb2afc4a9d71741e\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo4tA4BB5iBMIIXCANezySB57n53IEDQfg0Slzi\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=1972&bt=1972&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=NjxlNTQ6NjplOjlkaWQ7ZUBpM2Z5c3M5cjc4NDczNGllM0A1MGMwMDQuNWIxXzFfMmFfYSNtZmJnMmRjbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=40000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&feature_id=f0150a16a324336cda5d6dd0b69ed299&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","useInMobile":""},{"src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F28644da98e0a63b02004364ef3f2bbff\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002FoMAsXSMEBEBBEC44SLiADOeJwBfp0AAEimgK7I\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=10616&bt=10616&cs=0&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=13&rc=M2pqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0BpM2pqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0Ava2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzYSMva2kvMmRzbC5hLS1kXzBzcw%3D%3D&btag=c0000e00008000&dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837","description":"一个日出时分茂密森林的电影级航拍镜头，金色的光线透过层层晨雾流淌。镜头在树梢上方缓缓向前推移，远处一处瀑布逐渐显露。画面细节超现实般逼真，光线柔和，景深较浅，营造出梦幻般的氛围。","description_en":"A cinematic aerial shot of a dense forest at sunrise, where golden light filters through layers of morning mist. The camera glides slowly above the treetops as a distant waterfall gradually comes into view. The scene boasts hyper-realistic details, soft lighting, and a shallow depth of field, crafting a dreamlike atmosphere.","width":"1920","height":"1088","poster":"https:\u002F\u002Fp26-sign.douyinpic.com\u002Ftos-cn-p-13c08f\u002FoUbYulgIDQqCIEwwSXFDDI9TgBffo5AIEtgV7Q~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1749548249&l=2025061017372921DED736C711578F0837&x-expires=2064908254&x-signature=D4g53Q5VxVP5Jl%2Bj%2FLdfGINhmTg%3D","compress_src":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3-magicarena-v.365yg.com\u002F96dae02ef6e8eac8f708dbdfbe9c52ed\u002F7b13ffde\u002Fvideo\u002Ftos\u002Fcn\u002Ftos-cn-v-13c08f\u002Fo0IocYwYDSvwg9vegQFIQuDDTfVgXElEA7BSEI\u002F?a=611830&ch=0&cr=0&dr=0&er=0&lr=default&cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0&br=3037&bt=3037&cs=0&ds=3&ft=7ubAHfXEBBkq8Zmo_X58-_vjVQWw&mime_type=video_mp4&qs=0&rc=PDY6Mzc0NzhkODQ6ZGQ7NUBpM2pqNXI5cjc4NDczNGllM0AuNTU2MF8xXy0xYWM2NDViYS